      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): bound IDENTITY.md reads to prevent OOM",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`loadIdentityFromFile` in `src/agents/identity-file.ts` loaded `IDENTITY.md` with `fs.readFileSync(..., \"utf-8\")` and no size cap. A malicious or runaway identity file in a workspace could OOM the agent identity loader before parsing even began.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nIdentity files are small human-authored markdown; 1 MiB is generous headroom while preventing an unbounded read. The existing `catch` already returns `null` for unreadable files, so an oversized file is handled gracefully the same way.\n\n## User Impact\n\n- Workspace identity loading no longer buffers arbitrarily large `IDENTITY.md` files.\n- Oversized identity files are treated as missing (returns `null`) instead of crashing.\n- Normal identity files work exactly as before.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Replaced `fs.readFileSync` with `readRegularFileSync({ filePath, maxBytes: IDENTITY_FILE_MAX_BYTES })` in `src/agents/identity-file.ts`.\n- Added regression tests in `src/agents/identity-file.test.ts` covering normal load and an oversized file that exceeds the cap.\n- Local test run:\n  ```\n  node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/identity-file.test.ts --run\n  # 9 tests passed\n  ```\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nI created a workspace with an oversized `IDENTITY.md` (2 MiB) and ran `loadAgentIdentityFromWorkspace`. The loader returns `null` instead of buffering the oversized file:\n\n```text\n$ OPENCLAW_VITEST_MAX_WORKERS=1 node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/identity-file.test.ts --run\n[test] starting test/vitest/vitest.agents.config.ts\n RUN  v4.1.9\n ✓ |agents| src/agents/identity-file.test.ts (9 tests) 119ms\n     ✓ loads identity values from IDENTITY.md\n     ✓ returns null when IDENTITY.md exceeds the size cap\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  9 passed (9)\n[test] passed 1 Vitest shard in 11.05s\n```\n\nThe oversized identity file is rejected with `File exceeds 1048576 bytes`, and the agent loader falls back to no custom identity rather than risking OOM.",
        "branch": "fix/bound-identity-file-read",
